# fizzbuzz_init.ds - One-time initialization for FizzBuzz tape state.
#
# Sets:
#   c4 (C_UNTIL10) = 10
#   c8 (C_MOD3)    = 3
#   c11 (C_MOD5)   = 5
#   c14 (C_NEITHER)= 1
#   c15 (C_LOOPCNT)= 100
#
# Pre: all cells 0, ptr at c0.
# Post: tape initialized, ptr at c0.

GEAR 4 RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS 
GEAR 4 RIGHT GEAR 3 GAS 
GEAR 3 RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS 
PARK 
	LEFT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS 
	RIGHT BRAKE 
DRIVE 

GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 4 RIGHT GAS 
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 4 LEFT
